CE FND-114 gate: a CURRENT source (EX 4) over GN 2 lossy ground.
CE The class was ungated: every other EX 4 deck in the corpus is free space,
CE and the pattern gain correction only fires over a lossy finite ground, so
CE nothing exercised the two together. The GUI reported 6.34 dBi here where
CE the CLI reported 0.56 -- directivity read as gain, because the current
CE source leaves the excitation vector all zeros and the input power came out
CE exactly 0.
CE Geometry, ground and frequency are dipole-gn2-near-ground-51seg.nec
CE unchanged, so the ONLY difference from that fixture is the drive.
